# --- secrets and local config (never copy into an image layer) ---
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/*.pfx
**/*.crt
**/.dev-keys
**/appsettings.Development.json
**/secrets.dev.yaml
**/values.dev.yaml

# --- build output ---
**/bin
**/obj
**/TestResults

# --- VCS and IDE ---
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/.vs
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/.project
**/.settings
**/.toolstarget
**/*.user
**/*.dbmdl
**/*.jfm
**/.DS_Store

# --- container and deploy files ---
**/.containerignore
**/.dockerignore
**/Containerfile*
**/Dockerfile*
**/compose*.y*ml
**/docker-compose*
**/podman-compose*
**/azds.yaml
**/charts

# --- misc ---
**/node_modules
**/npm-debug.log
**/*.tar
**/*.tar.gz
LICENSE
README.md